+    "## 4.7 Evaluation, and why the published numbers cannot be used\n",
+    "\n",
+    "The training notebooks report a progression:\n",
+    "\n",
+    "| configuration | Recall@10 | Precision@10 |\n",
+    "|---|---:|---:|\n",
+    "| artist model, no synthetic edges | 0.0808 | 0.0387 |\n",
